WEBVTT

00:03.963 --> 00:06.431
Please don't look so sad.

00:08.801 --> 00:12.828
Don't worry.
I'll come after you later.

00:26.052 --> 00:28.612
Go, sis.

00:34.494 --> 00:36.223
A shield of thunder...

00:37.597 --> 00:38.621
Shiel...

00:45.672 --> 00:46.866
It's a promise.

00:54.180 --> 00:55.340
Good-bye.

01:05.758 --> 01:06.690
S-Seki!

01:08.461 --> 01:10.929
Please excuse my rudeness.

01:11.531 --> 01:14.398
My jurisdiction includes
the bodyguards.

01:14.467 --> 01:18.927
And to prevent any conflicts
before they happen.

01:19.405 --> 01:22.704
Those were the orders
handed down to me by Lord Kashin.

01:24.110 --> 01:27.341
You've sure had your way
with things, haven't you?

01:28.381 --> 01:30.212
She may only be a bodyguard...

01:30.283 --> 01:33.309
...but she planted some silly ideas
into the Maiden's head.

01:33.753 --> 01:38.622
Like a doll that's gained emotions
and has decided to defy her fate.

01:39.225 --> 01:42.524
The Maiden of Life
is a symbol of the Underground.

01:43.529 --> 01:47.932
But she tried to take her into
the filthy outside world.

01:48.000 --> 01:50.195
This is unacceptable!

01:51.471 --> 01:53.996
It's too late for your little speech.

01:55.708 --> 01:57.642
The Maiden is my jurisdiction.

01:58.411 --> 02:00.606
I'll take care of this independently.

02:01.547 --> 02:02.343
Independently?

02:02.915 --> 02:04.746
Does he want to use them?

02:06.052 --> 02:06.882
Seki...

02:08.688 --> 02:11.623
You have no place
in the Company.

02:11.691 --> 02:13.318
Go wherever you want.

02:38.718 --> 02:42.176
Yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

02:42.255 --> 02:45.986
kokoro umore naku nari sou

02:46.058 --> 02:49.550
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

02:49.629 --> 02:52.063
taisetsu na koto wa

02:52.131 --> 02:54.395
oshiete yo

02:54.467 --> 02:56.059
ne

02:56.235 --> 03:01.298
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

03:01.374 --> 03:05.936
Machigai dato omowa sete

03:06.612 --> 03:10.309
akireru hodoni aishiteta

03:10.383 --> 03:14.149
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

03:14.220 --> 03:17.485
osoreru koto nante nani

03:17.557 --> 03:21.323
hitotsu naito shinji teta

03:21.394 --> 03:24.921
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

03:24.997 --> 03:28.524
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

03:28.601 --> 03:31.900
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

03:31.971 --> 03:35.600
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

03:35.675 --> 03:41.545
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai

03:55.194 --> 03:58.464
The Assassins of Tower Gate
The Assassins of Tower Gate.

03:58.464 --> 04:02.025
The Assassins of Tower Gate

04:08.541 --> 04:11.135
A sightseeing day tour
of Undertown!

04:11.310 --> 04:12.641
Let's go!

04:12.712 --> 04:13.701
Yeah!

04:14.380 --> 04:15.813
Underground sights!

04:15.882 --> 04:18.373
The sunlight system
and Tower Gate!

04:18.451 --> 04:19.145
Yes!

04:19.218 --> 04:20.480
I'm so looking forward to it!

04:20.553 --> 04:24.387
Of course!
A showcase of Company technology.

04:24.457 --> 04:25.822
Truly impressi...

04:27.760 --> 04:29.284
What's the matter?

04:30.596 --> 04:31.324
I know!

04:31.397 --> 04:33.729
He's been leading the way...

04:33.799 --> 04:35.061
...but doesn't know where to go!

04:35.134 --> 04:37.370
Oh, how silly!

04:37.370 --> 04:38.037
Wind

04:38.037 --> 04:39.561
Wind
That's not it, you idiot!

04:39.639 --> 04:40.799
What?

04:41.340 --> 04:43.171
Why are we sightseeing?!

04:43.242 --> 04:44.732
Come on.

04:45.044 --> 04:46.443
It'll be a lot of fun.

04:47.179 --> 04:49.943
Soon the sunlight system
will shut down...

04:50.016 --> 04:52.951
...and Tower Gate will light up.

04:53.486 --> 04:57.855
Like sending a fabulous bouquet
of flowers to all those in love.

04:57.924 --> 05:01.519
The light of love!

05:01.594 --> 05:04.722
Never mind that!
Just take me to the Company!

05:05.431 --> 05:08.832
Why do I have to go
on your outing anyway?!

05:09.368 --> 05:10.596
It's pointless!

05:10.670 --> 05:13.332
The problem is that Chelsea
isn't awake yet.

05:15.341 --> 05:16.899
That may be so...

05:17.176 --> 05:18.905
...but it doesn't explain your backpack...

05:19.512 --> 05:22.037
You actually want to go
on this stupid tour!

05:22.515 --> 05:24.745
Now, now.
Let's take it easy.

05:25.284 --> 05:29.414
I don't have the time
to play around with you guys!

05:29.488 --> 05:30.477
You must be afraid.

05:30.690 --> 05:33.659
Afraid to learn how technically
advanced the Company is.

05:35.294 --> 05:37.524
I knew it.
That's exactly how you feel.

05:38.097 --> 05:41.123
If you knew our true power,
you'd lose your nerve.

05:41.334 --> 05:42.892
That's why you don't
want to know.

05:42.969 --> 05:44.266
You don't want to get near it.

05:44.804 --> 05:47.466
That's why you avoid going there.

05:47.707 --> 05:49.868
Nice little speech there...

05:49.942 --> 05:53.378
...but you just want us out of the
way so you can be with Blondie.

05:54.146 --> 05:55.408
Don't be silly!

05:55.748 --> 06:00.344
Even if I was to use that as
an excuse to be with Miss Rorec...

06:00.519 --> 06:02.316
Oh, to be alone with her.

06:02.388 --> 06:04.856
Alone with her...
Alone with her...!

06:06.926 --> 06:09.190
You really want to
get it on with her, huh?

06:23.609 --> 06:27.409
Well, are you going to do
as Pairon says?

06:30.783 --> 06:31.181
Who is that?

06:32.551 --> 06:33.984
How boring.

06:34.987 --> 06:38.184
Let's forget about our orders
and have some fun.

06:38.624 --> 06:39.886
What about Sound?

06:40.626 --> 06:42.218
Shadow's here too, right?

06:42.928 --> 06:44.156
Why not?

06:44.397 --> 06:47.093
It's been a while since
we've come this far.

06:49.935 --> 06:51.232
There you have it.

06:51.737 --> 06:57.073
Is this the first time you've played
outside your castle, Princess?

07:32.011 --> 07:36.948
Hey, that little princess
is a sneaky one.

07:37.349 --> 07:40.375
I'll have to use my power,
or I won't be able to catch her.

08:06.378 --> 08:07.436
Whoa.

08:07.513 --> 08:10.607
She really is getting away.

08:10.950 --> 08:12.747
Heat, that's enough playing.

08:13.853 --> 08:15.514
Enough playing?

08:16.355 --> 08:19.813
I'm sure you guys
want to play more than me.

08:20.559 --> 08:21.526
Huh?

08:23.562 --> 08:25.621
What's the big deal with
this Tower Gate...

08:25.698 --> 08:27.097
...and it lighting up?

08:28.067 --> 08:30.558
It's just a big building.

08:31.003 --> 08:33.563
There are plenty of those
on the surface.

08:34.140 --> 08:35.835
It's not just big.

08:36.242 --> 08:37.402
That's right.

08:37.710 --> 08:41.168
It's a giant elevator that leads to
the nerve center of the Company.

08:42.414 --> 08:43.938
Uh, that was a joke.

08:44.416 --> 08:46.281
It's just a big building.

08:47.753 --> 08:48.515
Ginnosuke!

08:48.888 --> 08:49.445
Let's go!

08:50.556 --> 08:51.921
W-Wait, Rumina!

08:52.391 --> 08:53.619
Hold on!

09:03.068 --> 09:03.762
Shiel...

09:04.170 --> 09:06.730
Please keep your promise.

09:21.954 --> 09:23.285
So, that's...

09:23.789 --> 09:26.383
That's the way leading to Ruri.

09:27.860 --> 09:29.851
It's nighttime now.

09:29.929 --> 09:31.920
It's time for the lighting up.

09:52.184 --> 09:53.310
Chelsea...

09:55.054 --> 09:55.850
Rumina...

09:57.122 --> 09:58.646
Ginnosuke...

09:59.491 --> 10:01.322
I want to see you all again.

10:02.561 --> 10:04.825
I want to see the sunlight again.

10:05.397 --> 10:07.627
I want to feel the wind again.

10:51.277 --> 10:52.369
Where am I?

10:56.148 --> 10:57.342
Tower Gate...

10:57.616 --> 10:59.777
I must be in Undertown.

11:02.888 --> 11:03.752
An explosion?

11:22.474 --> 11:23.702
How strange.

11:23.942 --> 11:25.876
The servers are down.

11:26.478 --> 11:28.275
What could be happening
at the Company?

11:31.617 --> 11:33.551
What on earth is going on?

11:34.420 --> 11:37.617
Could something have
happened to Ruri?!

11:46.298 --> 11:47.526
This is part of my work.

11:47.599 --> 11:51.467
There's panic on the streets
and I must protect Chelsea.

11:52.705 --> 11:53.672
What if...

11:54.673 --> 11:55.662
Chel...!

11:56.709 --> 11:58.040
Ow, ow, ow...

12:06.118 --> 12:08.450
She's awake!

12:09.621 --> 12:12.749
Miss Chelsea has moved.
Miss Chelsea has breathed.

12:12.825 --> 12:16.488
Miss Chelsea has looked at me.
Miss Chelsea has spoken.

12:16.562 --> 12:20.396
Miss Chelsea! Miss Chelsea!
Miss Chelsea! Miss Chelsea!

12:20.466 --> 12:21.455
Who are you?

12:21.667 --> 12:22.190
Some guard?

12:22.634 --> 12:24.864
She doesn't remember!

12:24.937 --> 12:28.134
We met shortly after
I joined the Company.

12:28.207 --> 12:31.506
We bumped into each other
in front of the elevator.

12:31.577 --> 12:35.343
Yes! Just like a moment ago!
You extended your hand to me!

12:35.414 --> 12:36.642
Whatever!

12:36.715 --> 12:37.682
Just tell me what's going on!

12:42.287 --> 12:43.254
Miss Chelsea!

12:44.289 --> 12:46.257
Guard! I have a favor to ask you!

12:48.360 --> 12:49.520
A mission?!

13:01.240 --> 13:04.607
Hey!
What are you planning on doing?!

13:04.877 --> 13:06.139
What do you think?!

13:08.514 --> 13:10.539
I'm going to go and check it out!

13:10.616 --> 13:12.140
Rumina!

13:27.800 --> 13:30.098
Maybe you should cut it out.

13:30.702 --> 13:32.033
I'm just having fun.

13:32.104 --> 13:33.162
Just some fun.

13:33.772 --> 13:36.536
We find and bring back
the Maiden of Life.

13:37.443 --> 13:41.106
And if anyone interferes,
we're free to attack and kill them.

13:42.181 --> 13:44.172
Those are our orders.

13:46.985 --> 13:48.213
There're coming.

13:48.420 --> 13:50.888
Maybe two of them.
Maybe three.

13:51.356 --> 13:52.584
They're quite fast.

13:56.495 --> 13:58.690
It seems like you still
want to have fun.

13:59.498 --> 14:01.466
Well so do I.

14:01.533 --> 14:04.161
I can't let you take my prey away.

14:04.770 --> 14:07.364
All right.
What about your bodyguard?

14:13.111 --> 14:15.272
How thoughtful,
considering you're just a kid.

14:20.752 --> 14:21.741
I don't know.

14:22.921 --> 14:25.412
I don't know what's going on...

14:25.491 --> 14:27.550
...but I feel like
I've got to go there!

14:29.361 --> 14:32.524
Please don't go off
on your own like that!

14:33.265 --> 14:34.857
Forget it, Rumina!

14:35.400 --> 14:38.460
There's a serious security system
on the Gate.

14:38.871 --> 14:41.704
There's no way unauthorized
people can get in!

14:42.174 --> 14:44.438
Whose side are you on, anyway?!

14:46.979 --> 14:51.040
There're two towers
and a bridge that connects them.

14:51.316 --> 14:55.252
Then there's a gate
at the second tower.

14:55.387 --> 14:59.551
Tower Gate is comprised
of those four parts.

14:59.925 --> 15:04.021
It seems that the explosion
happened where they connect.

15:04.129 --> 15:05.562
I can't believe it.

15:05.964 --> 15:06.521
So?

15:06.665 --> 15:07.927
How do we get in?

15:08.100 --> 15:10.568
I can't tell you that.

15:10.802 --> 15:13.635
We wouldn't want
any problems later, after all.

15:13.839 --> 15:14.806
That's right.

15:15.507 --> 15:20.308
But I wonder if this security
system is really all that secure.

15:20.379 --> 15:21.903
Don't you believe me?

15:22.114 --> 15:25.914
Well, all it takes to get in
is one card key, right?

15:26.084 --> 15:29.019
And that sudden explosion
might have shaken the mechanism, right?

15:29.555 --> 15:31.716
It's not as simple as you think!

15:32.190 --> 15:33.452
Watch carefully.

15:33.525 --> 15:38.019
First I input my personal number
and password.

15:38.564 --> 15:44.696
And then I have to insert the card key,
and then the door opens!

15:44.770 --> 15:45.794
Thank you very much!

15:49.775 --> 15:51.106
Thanks, Ginnosuke!

15:51.176 --> 15:52.006
I'm going in!

15:52.444 --> 15:54.036
Uh, wait a minute!

15:56.014 --> 15:57.504
It closed right away.

15:58.283 --> 16:00.308
That's the Company for you.

16:00.385 --> 16:02.910
They have a perfect
security system!

16:03.388 --> 16:04.480
Aww!

16:04.823 --> 16:07.018
This isn't the time to be
going on like that!

16:07.092 --> 16:10.994
Without the card key,
we can't get in ourselves!

16:13.799 --> 16:16.393
I'll stay here and stand watch...

16:16.468 --> 16:20.495
...you go get Jilherts!

16:23.375 --> 16:25.935
Wh-Why do I have to?

16:27.579 --> 16:28.409
Damn!

16:28.647 --> 16:31.241
Why doesn't the elevator work?!

16:56.508 --> 17:01.241
So you see, the Company is not
a benevolent organization!

17:01.313 --> 17:03.178
But, Chelsea...

17:25.570 --> 17:28.095
What a ridiculously
huge pedestrian bridge.

17:40.018 --> 17:42.384
I've been waiting for you,
wind user.

17:42.754 --> 17:45.689
If you know who I am, then...

17:47.859 --> 17:49.087
I'm with the Company.

17:49.695 --> 17:54.291
But Miss Chelsea, isn't the story
about the Dragons just a legend?

17:54.666 --> 17:55.257
I mean...

17:55.333 --> 17:59.963
...the Company maintains peace
and security in the Underground.

18:00.906 --> 18:05.070
The way you talk sounds just like
people from the resistance.

18:05.143 --> 18:06.337
Then...

18:06.411 --> 18:07.036
Huh?

18:08.613 --> 18:10.877
How do you explain him?

18:13.552 --> 18:14.951
I found you!

18:19.758 --> 18:21.555
Why isn't he using a power?

18:21.760 --> 18:24.126
Who is this guy, anyway?

18:26.832 --> 18:30.324
So you're the wind user who
moves like falling leaves!

18:30.402 --> 18:32.233
You're a real disappointment!

18:35.073 --> 18:36.062
He blocked me?

18:36.641 --> 18:38.768
I don't know if you're
an assassin or what...

18:38.844 --> 18:40.869
...but you don't have what it takes!

18:41.313 --> 18:43.144
Don't let it get to your head, kid.

18:43.215 --> 18:45.843
You're just a side job
to my real mission.

18:46.251 --> 18:48.276
Just a little pest!

18:50.021 --> 18:51.283
He's got strength all right.

18:57.996 --> 18:58.894
The ceiling?

19:41.006 --> 19:44.169
What is this?
This feeling I'm getting?

20:16.741 --> 20:18.868
Ruri!

20:25.951 --> 20:28.511
Rumina...

20:32.023 --> 20:36.585
Your life is mine!

20:44.302 --> 20:49.137
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.207 --> 20:55.146
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.213 --> 21:07.216
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.360 --> 21:19.259
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:19.337 --> 21:31.215
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.549 --> 21:40.514
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.592 --> 21:44.028
kikou to shita

21:44.095 --> 21:52.469
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.537 --> 22:01.445
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.722 --> 22:12.280
Preview

22:12.457 --> 22:15.119
These guys are
Pairon's special forces.

22:15.527 --> 22:16.892
Power users of darkness.

22:17.028 --> 22:20.987
If they're here, it must mean that
Ruri is here, too!

22:21.533 --> 22:22.522
This is bad.

22:22.600 --> 22:24.431
There should be more of them.

22:24.502 --> 22:26.595
I can't be held up here.

22:26.671 --> 22:29.367
I've got to meet up with Rumina and
the nerdy guy soon!

22:29.941 --> 22:32.501
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:32.577 --> 22:35.313
..."Raid - The Broken Bonds."

22:35.313 --> 22:40.216
Raid - The Broken Bonds
